        {
            "title": "Release Postponed",
            "date": "2020-05-01 09:20:42",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/3127131079128835773",
            "notes": "Hey Everyone!\nWe're sad to announce that we needed to further postpone the launch of SpaceEscapeVR due to the current worldwide situation.\nAs we are not full time developers we need to make sure we can get through these harsh times.\nDevelopment has not stopped, just slowed down.\n\nWe hope you are and stay healthy and safe!\nYour VRA-Games team!"
        },
        {
            "title": "Bugfixes!",
            "date": "2019-10-27 16:47:38",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2504491307415538084",
            "notes": "As you might have noticed, there has been a long time between the initial release and the last Update. \nBut you may also have noticed that in the last days SpaceEscapeVR has been patched again!\nThe game is not dead!\nWe just had so much work with our Arcade that we barely had any time left. But don't worry, the bughunt is still going on!\nIf you have found a bug, feel free to report it on our Discord: https://discord.gg/BH5BrtH (the devs speak english :D)"
        }
    ]
